Remove CConsole, Auto Define Symbols and Kuheylan VPN

Three of the fourteen projects added this week are out at the owner's request.
Each had a page, a card on the home page, cards on its category and tag pages,
and seven to eight image files; all of it is gone.

The taxonomy builder needed a change to manage it. It refreshed cards for
projects it knew about, so dropping a project from the list left its card
stranded on the category pages, still pointing at a page and images that no
longer exist. It now sweeps generated cards whose project is no longer listed
before inserting the current ones.

62 URLs in the sitemap, down from 65. Link check passes over 8950 references,
no broken targets and no unreferenced assets: the deleted images went with the
pages that used them.
